<!--
  Add inside ares-webportal/app/components/chargen-custom.hbs.
  This file contains tab-pane elements only. The id must match the href in
  chargen-custom-tabs.snippet.hbs. Do not add active/show unless you want
  SOUL to replace the game's existing default chargen tab on page load.

  If you already pasted an older version using {{soul/chargen}},
  <Soul::Chargen />, or a bare {{soul-chargen}} with no char= argument,
  replace it with the version below - char=this.char is required so staff
  running chargen for another character via the game's own /chargen/:id
  page (this tab) affects that character instead of silently editing the
  staff member's own Resonance/Skills/B&Bs (2026-07-31 live testing bug).
-->
<div class="tab-pane fade" id="soul-chargen-tab" role="tabpanel">
  {{soul-chargen char=this.char}}
</div>
